# M-A1 receipt-extraction golden cases. gold = resolved extraction the full pipeline
# (deterministic OCR core + routing>=0.70 + gap-fill + location reflection) should produce.
# ocr != gold on purpose for money/date so the normalizers must resolve it (not "canned==gold").
#
# AUTHORING CONTRACT (grounded in ai_agents/receipt_pipeline/{core,pipeline,reflection}.py):
#   - field_confidence >= 0.70 -> field kept deterministic (provenance=deterministic).
#   - field_confidence < 0.70 OR missing/null conf -> gap-fill (provenance=ai_inferred,
#     value = gap_fill_json[field]); ANY gap-filled field => processing_path=agent_gap_fill.
#   - location gap-fill WITH itinerary containing that city -> reflection outcome=passed ->
#     location kept (provenance=ai_inferred). location gap-fill WITHOUT itinerary -> written
#     ai_inferred from gap_fill_json. The metrics layer normalizes amount/date/currency on
#     BOTH sides via values_match, so gold carries the normalized value while ocr may differ.
#   - gold extracted_fields values are the grounded-correct RESOLVED values, never raw echoes.
#
# Coverage: airfare/hotel/meals/ground/rail/car; USD/EUR/GBP/JPY; ISO/US/EU date formats;
# tricky = low-conf->gap-fill, missing field, location reflection, money/date normalization.
#
# ==== DETERMINISTIC happy-path, per category x currency, with money/date NORMALIZATION ====
